Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790261999999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790207999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The 27 bars from 1787356800000 to 1789603200000 are a genuine trading range (2357.18-2680) with overlapping bars and no net progress, so much of the post-spike period is two-sided rather than a clean channel.", "The final bar 1790121600000 closed 2684.16, near the low of its range (close ~29%), back below the 2680 range top and the 2700 high of bar 1789776000000, so the breakout above the range has no follow-through yet.", "Bar 1787270400000 closed 2515.3 with a 255.7 upper tail after reaching 2771, showing sellers active near the highs; price then spent 27 bars below that high before exceeding it.", "The first ~70% of the window is a bear leg to 1368.42 plus a wide 1512.91-1974.46 range; a sustained bull trend is only visible from bar 1787097600000 onward, so the bull regime rests on the newer portion of the window."], "evidence_for": ["Two very large bull trend bars anchor the bull read: bar 1787097600000 (close 2252.16, top ~87% of range) and bar 1789948800000 (close 2775.61, top ~64% of a 208.3 range, new window high 2850).", "Swing sequence since the post-spike low is up: low 2358.62 (bar 1789430400000) held just above 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000) and was followed by a higher high at 2850.", "Bars 1789689600000-1789948800000 closed on progressively higher levels and closed above the 2680 top of the preceding 27-bar range, i.e. a breakout attempt at the upper boundary rather than at the lower one.", "The current pullback is shallow so far: two bars and 2641.37, roughly a 42% retrace of the 2358.62-2850 leg, and far above the 2357.18 range low, so no higher low has been broken."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars from 1779840000000 to 1790207999999; window low 1368.42 (bar 1780704000000 low), window high 2850 (bar 1789948800000 high).", "Opening bear leg: bars 1779840000000-1780704000000 fell from bar-0 high 2094.02 to bar-10 low 1368.42, with five consecutive lower closes (1859.02, 1813.04, 1731, 1581.32, 1568.55) and large bear ranges.", "Bars 1780790400000-1787011200000 stayed two-sided inside 1512.91 (bar-30 low) to 1974.46 (bar-61 high), heavy bar overlap, small bodies, no sustained trend.", "Bar 1787097600000 was the window's largest bull bar: open 1916.51, high 2293.8, low 1905.63, close 2252.16 (range 388.17, close in top ~87% of the bar).", "Bars 1787184000000-1787270400000 extended to highs 2348.02 and 2771, but the second closed 2515.3 with a 255.7 upper tail (close near 43% of its 445.69 range).", "Bars 1787356800000-1789603200000 traded sideways between 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000 low) and 2680 (bar 1789084800000 high) with overlapping bars and repeated two-sided closes.", "Bars 1789689600000-1789948800000 advanced from open 2446.22 to high 2850, closing above the 2680 top of that 27-bar range; the last bar of the leg, 1789948800000, closed 2775.61 in the top ~64% of its 208.3 range.", "Final two bars pulled back: 1789948800000 close 2752.43 and bar 1790121600000 open 2752.43, high 2786.81, low 2641.37, close 2684.16 (close near 29% of its 145.44 range), back below the 2680-2700 area.", "Pullback low 2641.37 retraces about 42% of the 2358.62-2850 advance, and recent swing sequence remains 2358.62 low (bar 1789430400000) vs 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000) with a higher high at 2850."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: ten bars of lower closes from bar-0 high 2094.02 down to bar-10 low 1368.42, dominated by five consecutive large bear bars; the low was not revisited for the rest of the window.", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779840000000, "upper_boundary": "2094.02"}, {"description": "Broad two-sided range after the bear leg, from bar-30 low 1512.91 to bar-61 high 1974.46; overlapping bars, small bodies, no clean trend bars in either direction.", "end_time_ms": 1787011200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike from bar 1787097600000 (open 1916.51, close 2252.16, low 1905.63) through highs 2348.02 and 2771; the spike closed the range at 1512.91-1974.46 and is the largest single-bar expansion in the window.", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range, 27 bars between bar 1788307200000 low 2357.18 and bar 1789084800000 high 2680; repeated overlapping bars and mid-bar closes show two-sided trading below the 2771 spike high.", "end_time_ms": 1789603200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Four-bar bull leg from bar 1789689600000 (open 2446.22, low 2436.87) up to the window high 2850 at bar 1789948800000, closing above the 2357.18-2680 range top; bars 1790035200000 and 1790121600000 then pulled back to 2641.37 and closed back below the 2680-2700 area, so acceptance above the range is not yet shown.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2850, or two consecutive closes above 2786.81 (bar 1790121600000 high), would show acceptance above the range and make the current phase spike-like rather than channel-like.", "Range/failed breakout: a close below 2641.37 (bar 1790121600000 low) followed by a close below 2436.87 (bar 1789689600000 low) would return price into the 2357.18-2680 range and shift the read toward trading-range/range.", "Bull-trend invalidation: a close below 2357.18 would break the range low and the higher-low sequence, re-opening a bear leg toward the 1789430400000 low area.", "A sequence of overlapping bars holding between 2680 and 2850 with no new high would confirm the recent advance as a channel segment inside an increasingly range-like structure."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790251199999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["No new high in 18 bars after 2850 and successive lower highs 2804.59 (1790020800000) then 2786.81 (1790136000000): bull momentum has stalled at the top of the range.", "Bar 1790164800000 closed 2659.00, below the 2716.01-2727.77 floor of the prior 12-bar consolidation, and the last bar 1790236800000 closed 2647.90 near its low 2633.31, undercutting the 2648.49 low: a bearish change of character at the local level, with the bounce only reaching 2698.06.", "The 2358.62-2850 advance is roughly 21% in about 34 bars and ends with a 191.19-point range bar and an upper tail on the 2850.00 bar, a possible climactic finish that can be followed by a deeper two-legged correction toward 2568.16.", "Neither a bull reversal bar nor a reclaim of 2693.42/2716.01 has appeared, so acceptance of the lower prices and a possible MTR-like reversal toward 2568.16 cannot be excluded."], "evidence_for": ["Sustained higher highs and higher lows from 2358.62 to 2850 (2481.66, 2585.50, 2643.52, 2700.00, 2850) with pullback lows 2436.87 and 2568.16: a multi-leg bull structure, not a single bar or one leg.", "The window low 2358.62 (1789488000000) closed 2412.95, and the rally that followed broke above the prior balance-zone high 2680 (1789128000000), closing 2723.15 on the 2850.00 bar: a bull breakout with follow-through into a channel.", "The current pullback of 216.69 points is about 45% of the 2370.54-2850 leg, inside the usual bull-flag correction depth, and no bar has closed below the last major higher low 2568.16 (1789891200000).", "The 18 bars after 2850 largely overlap (bodies small, alternating direction) with the established floor at 2716.01-2722.76 holding until bar 1790164800000: two-sided trade inside a bull trend rather than a one-way bear leg."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window of 120 closed H4 bars from open 2523.22 (1788523200000) to last close 2647.90 (1790236800000); window low 2358.62 (1789488000000) and window high 2850 (1789977600000).", "First ~74 bars are a two-sided balance zone: repeated highs 2527.18-2528.80, floor area 2411.04 (1789041600000) and 2442.93 (1788984000000), a 2680.00 spike high (1789128000000), then a sell-off to the window low 2358.62 (1789488000000) that closed 2412.95, i.e. rejected within the same bar.", "Bull leg from 2358.62 to 2850: higher highs 2481.66 (1789646400000), 2585.50 (1789732800000), 2643.52 (1789747200000), 2700.00 (1789804800000), 2850 (1789977600000), with pullback lows 2436.87 (1789660800000) and 2568.16 (1789891200000); strong bull bars close 2636.28 (1789747200000) and 2658.81 to 2723.15 on the 2850.00 bar.", "Since the 2850 high: 18 bars with no new high, highs capped at 2804.59 (1790020800000) and 2786.81 (1790136000000), lows 2716.01 (1790064000000), 2717.02/2718.09 area, then 2648.49 (1790164800000) and 2633.31 (1790236800000); alternating bull/bear closes with small overlapping bodies = two-sided trade.", "Bar 1790164800000 (open 2726.71, high 2727.77, low 2648.49, close 2659.00) closed below the 2716.01-2727.77 consolidation floor; the following bounce reached only 2698.06 (1790222400000), a lower high below the broken floor.", "Last bar 1790236800000 (open 2692.23, high 2693.42, low 2633.31, close 2647.90) closed in the lower quarter of its 60.11-point range, marginally undercutting the 2648.49 low of the prior leg.", "Pullback from 2850 to 2633.31 is 216.69 points, about 45% of the 479.46-point leg from 2370.54 (1789574400000) to 2850; the last major higher low 2568.16 is 65.85 points below the last low."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Two-sided balance zone of the first ~74 bars: highs 2527.18-2528.80, floor near 2411.04-2442.93, a 2680.00 spike high at 1789128000000, and a sell-off to the window low 2358.62 at 1789488000000 that closed 2412.95 (rejected immediately) before the base into 1789588799999.", "end_time_ms": 1789588799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1788523200000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Bull swing from the 2358.62 low to the 2850.00 high: higher highs 2481.66, 2585.50, 2643.52, 2700.00, 2850, with pullback lows 2436.87 and 2568.16; the advance broke above the 2680.00 high of the prior balance zone and the 2850.00 bar closed 2723.15 after a 191.19-point range.", "end_time_ms": 1789977600000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Post-spike two-sided range after the 2850.00 high: 18 overlapping bars, highs capped at 2804.59 and 2786.81, floor zone 2716.01-2722.76 pierced by bar 1790164800000 to 2648.49 (close 2659.00); bounce to 2698.06 stayed below the broken floor and the last bar undercut it to 2633.31, closing 2647.90 with no accepted breakout.", "end_time_ms": 1790251199999, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2648.49", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Possible major-trend-reversal setup against the bull trend: 2850.00 high (1789977600000), lower high 2786.81 (1790136000000), and a strong bear bar 1790164800000 (range 79.28, close 2659.00) closing below the 2716.01-2722.76 floor; confirmation would require a break of the last major higher low 2568.16, which is still untested.", "end_time_ms": 1790251199999, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2568.16", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A close below 2568.16 (last major higher low, 1789891200000) with a follow-through bar would confirm an MTR-like top and shift the read from bull trend toward a bear leg/transition.", "Acceptance below 2633.31 (a close under it plus a second close lower) would confirm a bear breakout from the post-spike two-sided range and make the phase a bear channel rather than a range.", "A bull reversal bar closing above 2693.42 (last bar high) and then a close back above 2716.01 would indicate the pullback is ending and reassert the bull flag, keeping focus on 2786.81 and 2804.59.", "Continued overlapping bars holding between 2633.31 and 2804.59 without acceptance outside them keeps the two-sided range phase and medium always-in relevance unchanged."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2640.01", "close_time_ms": 1789833599999, "high": "2646.36", "low": "2636.29", "open": "2637.93", "open_time_ms": 1789830000000, "volume": "1922663.187"}, {"close": "2648", "close_time_ms": 1789837199999, "high": "2649.83", "low": "2635.92", "open": "2640.01", "open_time_ms": 1789833600000, "volume": "1461504.185"}, {"close": "2645.08", "close_time_ms": 1789840799999, "high": "2658.79", "low": "2642.65", "open": "2648", "open_time_ms": 1789837200000, "volume": "1728830.613"}, {"close": "2637.94", "close_time_ms": 1789844399999, "high": "2646.54", "low": "2635.27", "open": "2645.08", "open_time_ms": 1789840800000, "volume": "1685846.619"}, {"close": "2633.54", "close_time_ms": 1789847999999, "high": "2639.17", "low": "2632.22", "open": "2637.94", "open_time_ms": 1789844400000, "volume": "1364559.754"}, {"close": "2634.57", "close_time_ms": 1789851599999, "high": "2639.17", "low": "2632.31", "open": "2633.54", "open_time_ms": 1789848000000, 